# Every-5-min Google Postmaster Tools sweep.
# Two roles in one script:
#   1. trafficStats pull (idempotent upsert on (domain, date) - cheap)
#   2. CRM lifecycle handoff: shards in pending_verify status need their
#      gpt_status flipped to 'verified' as soon as Google's domains.list
#      reports them. 5-min cadence keeps the operator's "verify in GPT UI ->
#      see Verified in CRM" loop tight without burning quota.
#
# /api/shards/{domain}/gpt-refresh also triggers this script ad-hoc so
# impatient operators don't have to wait for the next 5-min tick.
*/5 * * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/gpt-poller/poll.py
